  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.0.0 - Initial Release\n\n      Features:\n      - Visual entity selection with search functionality\n      - Custom action support for Dataverse workflows\n      - Target framework selection (.NET 8.0 and 9.0)\n      - Secure credential management using Windows Credential Manager\n      - Complete MCP project generation with ZIP export\n      - Claude Desktop integration support\n      - Real-time progress tracking during generation\n      - Password visibility toggle for client secrets\n      - Async operations prevent UI freezing\n      - Responsive design that adapts to window resizing\n\n      This is the first public release with core functionality for building MCP servers from Dataverse metadata.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Visual code generator that transforms Dataverse metadata into production-ready Model Context Protocol servers with AI agent integration",
